  "title": "About Us Online catalog",
  "text": "About Us Online catalog AF Kathmandu Catalog About Us Culturethèque/ Online Library Nom du réseau réseau médiathèques Catalog About Us Culturethèque/ Online Library Select language Français English (UK) Search Recherche avancée Home Select language Français English (UK) Historique Connection help / Aide à la connexion Login user name Forgotten password? Address AF Kathmandu Teku 72500 Kathmandu, Nepal Nepal library@mediatheques-afnepal.org Home About Us Update search Home About Us Welcome to the Alliance Française Library — a place to explore, learn, and connect with all things French! In our space, you’ll find: 5,000+ books\n     on everything from literature to culture 285 DVDs\n     with French films (many with English subtitles) 50+ board\n     games A video game station with a PlayStation and\n     5 different games Our library has something for everyone , whether you’re just starting out in French or a fluent speaker. You’ll find French literature , a huge comic book collection , magazines and newspapers , and plenty of DVDs to explore. For students, we’ve got “La Bibliothèque de l’Apprenant” , a section specially curated to help with your studies. And don’t worry about devices— our computers are here for anyone to use. Drop by to explore, learn, or just enjoy some quiet time with a good book. Horaires d'ouverture Monday to Friday : 8:30 AM to 5:45PM Closed on : Saturday & Sunday also on AFK public holidays Coordonnées Alliance Française de Katmandou 1100 Damkal Sundarighat Marg, Ward no.4, Pulchowk - Dhobighat Rd, Lalitpur, Népal (behind St. Mary’s School) Phone: 01 5409 221 / 01 5420 466 email: library@afknepal.com / info@afknepal.com Λ Mentions légales Contact A- A A+",
